      "claim": "Jalāl ad‑Dīn Muhammad Rūmī was a 13th‑century Persian poet, Islamic scholar, and Sufi mystic.",
      "evidence": "Historical biographies and Rumi's own writings identify him as a central figure in Persian literature and Sufism.",
